  k=13 (dissociated = longest-AP <= 7):
   spread  #arcs   rho*     D3  c=#/spr (i)#<rho(spr+1)  (ii)c<D3 (iii)minL*spr trivBnd/#arcs
       40     28  0.940  0.590   0.7000             YES        NO         0.067           184x
