  READING: (i) pigeonhole #arcs<rho*(spread+1) => good period EXISTS -- the target.
           (ii) mac-mini c<D3 (cleaner, exact+dilation-invariant). (iii) min-arc*spread:
           if bounded below by const>0 then #arcs<=rho*/minL=O(spread) with GOOD constant.
           trivBnd/#arcs = how loose the trivial O(k^2 spread) a-priori bound is (the GAP).
